1
00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:02,130
(Wyatt:)You're a grown woman,
and I respect your right

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:03,990
(Wyatt:)to make your own decisions,
but all I ask

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
(Wyatt:)is you respect me enough
to be honest about them.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,870
(Penny:)You're right. Look, from now on,
I will tell you the truth.

5
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:11,050
(Wyatt:)Thank you. Now, why don't you go
and put some clothes on

6
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:13,470
(Wyatt:)and we'll grab a bite to eat
before I head for the airport.

7
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:15,140
(Sheldon:)- Now you.
- Daddy, he had nothing to do...

8
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,970
- Keep walking.
- Okay.

9
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:24,080
(Wyatt:)Please, please, please
don't give up on her.

10
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:28,150
(Leonard:)What?

11
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:30,220
(Wyatt:)I can't go back to the
skateboard idiots,

12
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,820
(Wyatt:)the white rappers
and all those

13
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:35,230
(Wyatt:)sweaty dumb-asses with
their backwards hats.

14
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:39,230
(Leonard:)Gee, I don't know
if it's in the cards, sir.

15
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:40,730
(Wyatt:)Then, stack the deck.

16
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:42,170
(Wyatt:)Cheat.

17
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:44,270
(Wyatt:)Lie. I don't care.

18
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:45,870
(Wyatt:)I want grandkids before I die,

19
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:48,770
(Wyatt:)and I want them to grow up
in a house without wheels.

20
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:56,410
(Leonard:)I'll give it a shot.

21
00:00:56,410 --> 00:00:58,080
(Wyatt:)Thank you.

22
00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:59,970
(Wyatt:)Now I'm going to do something
here to help you along.

23
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:01,640
(Leonard:)Excuse me?
Just don't panic.

